{"availability":"available","full":"img2threejs/img2threejs","name":"img2threejs","description":"Rebuild the object in a reference image as a code-only, procedural, quality-gated, animation-ready Three.js model. Token-efficient image-to-3D.","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":18242,"forks":1586,"created":"2026-07-15T02:58:39Z","updated":"2026-10-08T04:50:41Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://img2threejs.io","topics":["3d","ai-agents","claude-code","computer-graphics","generative","image-to-3d","procedural-generation","threejs","typescript","webgl"],"demo":"https://img2threejs.io/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T21:33:33.325Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T21:33:33.325Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T21:33:33.325Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:23:30.403Z","stars":17539,"forks":1465},{"at":"2026-10-07T20:14:09.917Z","stars":17650,"forks":1474},{"at":"2026-10-08T16:05:39.385Z","stars":17713,"forks":1485},{"at":"2026-10-11T00:24:48.868Z","stars":17880,"forks":1507},{"at":"2026-10-16T21:33:33.325Z","stars":18242,"forks":1586}],"technologies":["Three.js","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Rebuild the object in a reference image as a code-only, procedural Three.js model.","Quality-gated, animation-ready, and deliberately token-efficient — reconstruction-by-code, not photogrammetry, mesh extraction, or downloaded art packs.","Reference images reconstructed in code as animation-ready Three.js models, running live in the browser."],"features":["Scripts enforce, the model judges. The Python scripts handle validation, gating, spec authoring, PBR extraction, comparison-sheet packaging, and pipeline state. They never score visuals. The model's tokens go to one…","Zero dependencies, zero install churn. Every script is pure Python 3.10+ standard library. No pip, no PIL, no numpy, no Playwright. PNG read/write is done with struct and zlib. Nothing to install means nothing to debug…","Pass-gated generation. The code generator emits only the currently unlocked build pass. The model does not regenerate or re-read the entire model on every iteration — each step is small and scoped.","Fail fast, before codegen. A strict-quality gate blocks shallow specs before a single line of Three.js is generated, so you never spend tokens rendering a model that was underspecified from the start.","One image per review. Each pass is judged from exactly one packaged comparison sheet (reference beside render), not a scattering of screenshots."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/img2threejs/img2threejs/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b781c6c8a1bd6ca98f4909913824f63c6e11683dae47cb1f9187ead5d8927d7a","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:39.456Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:39.456Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Rebuild the object in a reference image as a code-only, procedural Three.js model.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/img2threejs/img2threejs/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"A cost ceiling — Stay at low effort and skip the presentation composer; I only need the evaluation render.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/img2threejs/img2threejs/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"b781c6c8a1bd6ca98f4909913824f63c6e11683dae47cb1f9187ead5d8927d7a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/img2threejs/img2threejs/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:39.457Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T04:50:41Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/img2threejs/img2threejs/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:39.460Z","hash":"b781c6c8a1bd6ca98f4909913824f63c6e11683dae47cb1f9187ead5d8927d7a","originalBytes":49545,"storedBytes":49545,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:39.385Z","enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:40.719Z","latestRelease":{"name":"2.0.0: The Plugin Update","tag":"v2.0.0","publishedAt":"2